# Posit Publisher: ignore everything under .posit/ by default, but track
# the shareable deployment + configuration .toml files so team members /
# other machines can deploy to the same Connect / Connect Cloud content.
# Credentials live in the OS keychain, never in these files.
.posit/
!.posit/
!.posit/publish/
!.posit/publish/**/*.toml
.positai
